  - "I don\u2019t think you know what a trope is\u2026"
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,10,3>UP BAP BAP, shhhhhhhh
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,10,3>You hear that?
  - ...
  - The negative Nancy is gone.
